   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civ Soc ICT Advocacy/APC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet globala informationssamh&#xe4;llet Watch (GISWatch) &#xe4;r v&#xe4;rd f&#xf6;r APC. Det &#xe4;r b&#xe5;de en publikation och en process med det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let att &#xf6;ka bredden och tillg&#xe5;ngen till ICT och st&#xe4;rka  regeringarnas ansvar. Projektets m&#xe5;l att bygga upp kapacitet och kompetens bland afrikanska civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer o att delta i nationella ICT-processer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Global Information Society Watch (GISWatch) is hosted by APC. It is both a publication and a process with the overall objective of increasing affordable and wide spread access to ICT and strengthen accountability of governments. The project objective entails building capacity and advocacy skills among African civil society organisations to engage in national ICT policy processes.</narrative>
  </description>
